OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,6,Fshowers or perhaps some longer spells
OL,7,Fof rain, heavy for a time. Chance of
OL,8,Frain becoming quite persistent over
OL,9,FCaithness. Brighter conditions at
OL,10,Ftimes towards Easter Ross.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain or showers continuing in
OL,13,Fthe evening, possibly remaining
OL,14,Fpersistent for Caithness. Some hill
OL,15,Ffog around the west coast, a few
OL,16,Fclearer spells developing overnight
OL,17,Ffor Wester Ross.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
