OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FLight and patchy rain slow
OL,6,Fto clear during the morning but a
OL,7,Fchange to cooler, northerly winds will
OL,8,Fbring brighter conditions through the
OL,9,Fafternoon, few showers later in the
OL,10,Fnorth.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FFresher conditions in northerly winds
OL,14,Fwith scattered showers at times, a lot
OL,15,Fof brighter weather too particularly
OL,16,Ftowards the weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
